---
import HubCitableStats from '../hub/HubCitableStats.astro';
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-iibb-hub" set:html={`<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><b>Impuestos</b> / Ingresos Brutos / Argentina</div><div class="hero-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">24 jurisdicciones, una entrada clara</span><h1>Encontrá cuánto pagás de IIBB donde realmente trabajás.</h1><p class="lead">Elegí provincia y actividad, hacé una cuenta rápida y entrá al detalle local con alícuotas, organismo, mínimos y reglas propias.</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill">✓ Todas las provincias</span><span class="pill">✓ 10 actividades</span><span class="pill">✓ Retenciones y saldo</span></div></div><aside class="hero-card"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#bfd3ef">El impuesto provincial</span><div class="map"><div class="map-shape"></div></div><h2>Facturación × alícuota − créditos</h2><p>Se calcula sobre ingresos brutos, no sobre la ganancia.</p><div class="hero-mini"><div><small>JURISDICCIONES</small><strong>24</strong></div><div><small>BASE</small><strong>Sin descontar gastos</strong></div></div></aside></div></div></section>
<section class="finder"><div class="wrap"><header class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Paso 1</span><h2>¿En qué provincia tributás?</h2><p>Buscá o tocá una jurisdicción. La selección baja directamente al cálculo rápido.</p></header><div class="search-box"><span>⌕</span><input id="provinceSearch" placeholder="Buscar provincia…"></div><div class="province-grid" id="provinceGrid"></div></div></section>
<section class="quick" id="quick"><div class="wrap"><header class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Paso 2</span><h2>Calculá una referencia mensual.</h2><p>La alícuota es editable porque puede cambiar por código de actividad, escala o beneficio.</p></header><div class="calc-grid"><article class="panel"><h3>Tu operación</h3><p class="intro">Valores mensuales y sin IVA. Verificá la alícuota en la página provincial.</p><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="province">Provincia</label><select id="province"></select></div><div class="field"><label for="activity">Actividad</label><select id="activity"></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="billing">Facturación gravada sin IVA</label><div class="money"><span>$</span><input id="billing" value="2.000.000" inputmode="numeric"></div></div><div class="field"><label for="rate">Alícuota aplicable</label><input id="rate" type="number" min="0" max="15" step=".1" value="3.5"><div class="help">Referencia editable; la ley tarifaria local es la fuente final.</div></div><div class="field"><label for="credits">Retenciones y percepciones</label><div class="money"><span>$</span><input id="credits" value="18.000" inputmode="numeric"></div></div><div class="field full"><label for="previous">Saldo a favor anterior</label><div class="money"><span>$</span><input id="previous" value="0" inputmode="numeric"></div></div></div><button class="go" id="calculate">Actualizar cálculo</button><p class="privacy">Orientativo. Puede existir un mínimo mensual o régimen simplificado.</p></article>
<article class="panel result"><div class="result-top"><div><h3 id="resultTitle">Saldo estimado del período</h3><p class="intro" id="resultCaption">Contribuyente local en Buenos Aires.</p></div><span class="status" id="status">ARBA</span></div><div class="big-label">SALDO A INGRESAR</div><div class="big" id="mainValue">$52.000</div><div class="sub" id="mainSub"></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-head"><span>Créditos aplicados</span><strong id="creditPct">26%</strong></div><div class="track"><i id="creditBar"></i></div><p>Retenciones, percepciones y SIRCREB son pagos a cuenta, no un impuesto adicional.</p></div><div class="rows" id="rows"></div><div class="notice" id="notice"></div><a class="detail-link" id="detailLink" href="https://hacecuentas.com/iibb/buenos-aires" target="_blank">Ver detalle de Buenos Aires →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="activities"><div class="wrap"><header class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Explorá por actividad</span><h2>La alícuota cambia más por rubro de lo que parece.</h2><p>Elegí una actividad para cargar su rango típico en la cuenta rápida.</p></header><div class="activity-grid" id="activityGrid"></div></div></section>
<section class="explain"><div class="wrap"><header class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Antes de liquidar</span><h2>Tres decisiones que cambian toda la cuenta.</h2></header><div class="cards"><article class="info dark"><span>UNA PROVINCIA</span><h3>Contribuyente local</h3><p>Tributás toda la base en una jurisdicción según su actividad, escala y beneficios.</p></article><article class="info"><span>VARIAS PROVINCIAS</span><h3>Convenio Multilateral</h3><p>Distribuís ingresos entre jurisdicciones. No corresponde cargar el total en cada una.</p></article><article class="info"><span>PAGOS A CUENTA</span><h3>Retenciones y percepciones</h3><p>Se descuentan del impuesto determinado. Si exceden, generan saldo a favor.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="faq"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div class="faq-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Preguntas frecuentes</span><h2>IIBB sin perderse entre provincias.</h2><p>Las reglas básicas antes de entrar al detalle local.</p></div><div><div class="faq-item open"><button><span>¿IIBB se calcula sobre la ganancia?</span><b>+</b></button><div class="answer">No. Se aplica sobre la facturación gravada, sin descontar gastos del negocio.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button><span>¿Cuándo corresponde Convenio Multilateral?</span><b>+</b></button><div class="answer">Cuando desarrollás actividad en dos o más jurisdicciones. La base se distribuye con las reglas del convenio.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button><span>¿SIRCREB es un impuesto adicional?</span><b>+</b></button><div class="answer">No. Es una retención bancaria a cuenta de IIBB que debe computarse en la declaración.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button><span>¿El monotributo nacional incluye IIBB?</span><b>+</b></button><div class="answer">No siempre. Algunas provincias tienen monotributo unificado o régimen simplificado; otras exigen inscripción y pago separado.</div></div></div></div></section>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-iibb-hub')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-iibb-hub');

const $=s=>root.querySelector(s),ars=n=>"$"+Math.round(n||0).toLocaleString("es-AR"),num=v=>Number(String(v).replace(/\D/g,""))||0;
const provinces=[["buenos-aires","Buenos Aires","ARBA",3.5],["caba","CABA","AGIP",3.5],["catamarca","Catamarca","ARCA Catamarca",3],["chaco","Chaco","ATP",3.5],["chubut","Chubut","DGR",3.5],["cordoba","Córdoba","Rentas Córdoba",4],["corrientes","Corrientes","DGR",3.5],["entre-rios","Entre Ríos","ATER",4],["formosa","Formosa","DGR",3],["jujuy","Jujuy","Rentas Jujuy",3],["la-pampa","La Pampa","DGR",3],["la-rioja","La Rioja","DGIP",3],["mendoza","Mendoza","ATM",4],["misiones","Misiones","ATM",4.5],["neuquen","Neuquén","DPR",3],["rio-negro","Río Negro","ART",3.5],["salta","Salta","DGR",3.6],["san-juan","San Juan","DGR",3.5],["san-luis","San Luis","DPIP",3],["santa-cruz","Santa Cruz","ASIP",3],["santa-fe","Santa Fe","API",4.5],["santiago-del-estero","Santiago del Estero","DGR",3],["tierra-del-fuego","Tierra del Fuego","AREF",3],["tucuman","Tucumán","DGR",5]];
const activities=[["comercio-minorista","Comercio minorista","3%–5%","▣",1],["comercio-mayorista","Comercio mayorista","2%–3,5%","▤",-0.5],["servicios-profesionales","Servicios profesionales","3%–5%","◎",.5],["construccion","Construcción","2,5%–4%","▥",0],["industria-manufacturera","Industria manufacturera","0%–2,5%","▦",-1.5],["transporte-logistica","Transporte y logística","2%–4%","▰",0],["tecnologia-software","Tecnología y software","0%–5%","⌘",0],["gastronomia-hoteleria","Gastronomía y hotelería","3%–5,5%","◫",1],["salud-medicina","Salud y medicina","0%–4%","＋",-1],["agropecuario-rural","Agropecuario y rural","0%–1,5%","◇",-2]];
function renderProvinces(filter=""){const q=filter.toLowerCase();$("#provinceGrid").innerHTML=provinces.filter(p=>p[1].toLowerCase().includes(q)).map(p=>`<button class="province" data-slug="${p[0]}"><strong>${p[1]}</strong><small>${p[2]}</small></button>`).join("");root.querySelectorAll(".province").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>selectProvince(b.dataset.slug,true)))}
function renderSelects(){$("#province").innerHTML=provinces.map(p=>`<option value="${p[0]}">${p[1]}</option>`).join("");$("#activity").innerHTML=activities.map(a=>`<option value="${a[0]}">${a[1]}</option>`).join("");$("#activityGrid").innerHTML=activities.map(a=>`<button class="activity" data-id="${a[0]}"><span>${a[3]}</span><strong>${a[1]}</strong><small>Rango típico: ${a[2]}</small></button>`).join("");root.querySelectorAll(".activity").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{$("#activity").value=b.dataset.id;applyReference();location.hash="quick"}))}
function selectProvince(slug,scroll=false){$("#province").value=slug;root.querySelectorAll(".province").forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle("selected",b.dataset.slug===slug));applyReference();if(scroll)location.hash="quick"}
function applyReference(){const p=provinces.find(x=>x[0]===$("#province").value)||provinces[0],a=activities.find(x=>x[0]===$("#activity").value)||activities[0];$("#rate").value=Math.max(0,p[3]+a[4]).toFixed(1);calculate()}
function calculate(){const p=provinces.find(x=>x[0]===$("#province").value)||provinces[0],billing=num($("#billing").value),rate=Math.max(0,+$("#rate").value||0),credits=num($("#credits").value)+num($("#previous").value),tax=billing*rate/100,balance=tax-credits,saldo=Math.max(0,balance),favor=Math.max(0,-balance),pct=tax?Math.min(100,credits/tax*100):0;$("#resultCaption").textContent=`Contribuyente local en ${p[1]}.`;$("#status").textContent=p[2];$("#mainValue").textContent=ars(saldo);$("#mainSub").textContent=favor?`No pagás este período y queda ${ars(favor)} de saldo a favor.`:`Impuesto determinado menos pagos a cuenta.`;$("#creditPct").textContent=Math.round(pct)+"%";$("#creditBar").style.width=pct+"%";$("#rows").innerHTML=[["Facturación gravada",ars(billing),""],["Alícuota aplicada",String(rate).replace(".",",")+"%",""],["Impuesto determinado",ars(tax),""],["Retenciones y saldo previo",ars(credits),"good"],[favor?"Saldo a favor":"Saldo a ingresar",ars(favor||saldo),favor?"good":"warn"]].map(x=>`<div class="row"><span>${x[0]}</span><strong class="${x[2]}">${x[1]}</strong></div>`).join("");$("#notice").innerHTML="<b>Verificá:</b> alícuota, mínimo mensual, exenciones y régimen simplificado en la jurisdicción.";$("#detailLink").href=`https://hacecuentas.com/iibb/${p[0]}`;$("#detailLink").textContent=`Ver detalle de ${p[1]} →`}
$("#provinceSearch").addEventListener("input",e=>renderProvinces(e.target.value));$("#province").addEventListener("change",()=>selectProvince($("#province").value));$("#activity").addEventListener("change",applyReference);$("#calculate").addEventListener("click",calculate);["billing","rate","credits","previous"].forEach(id=>$("#"+id).addEventListener("change",calculate));root.querySelectorAll(".faq-item button").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>b.parentElement.classList.toggle("open")));renderProvinces();renderSelects();selectProvince("buenos-aires");

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-iibb-hub{--ink:#172035;--navy:#243958;--blue:#3c78d3;--sky:#edf5ff;--mint:#eaf8f2;--green:#16805f;--cream:#f7f7f2;--line:#dfe4eb;--muted:#687487;--gold:#e6a958;--red:#df6f67}.mockup-iibb-hub *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-iibb-hub{scroll-behavior:smooth}.mockup-iibb-hub{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-iibb-hub .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px}.mockup-iibb-hub button,.mockup-iibb-hub input,.mockup-iibb-hub select{font:inherit}.mockup-iibb-hub button{cursor:pointer}.mockup-iibb-hub .site-head{height:82px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e8ed;display:flex;align-items:center}.mockup-iibb-hub .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:31px}.mockup-iibb-hub .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:19px;font-weight:900}.mockup-iibb-hub .logo{width:30px;height:38px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--navy);color:white;display:grid;place-items:center}.mockup-iibb-hub .links{display:flex;gap:25px;color:#576273;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.mockup-iibb-hub .tools{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:9px}.mockup-iibb-hub .tools button{height:42px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:white;color:#687386;padding:0 15px}.mockup-iibb-hub .tools .sq{width:42px;padding:0}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero{padding:46px 0 62px;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#fbfdfb,#f2f7ff)}.mockup-iibb-hub .crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7b8697;margin-bottom:35px}.mockup-iibb-hub .crumb b{color:var(--blue)}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:55px;align-items:center}.mockup-iibb-hub .eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:900;color:var(--blue)}.mockup-iibb-hub h1{font-size:51px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:14px 0 18px}.mockup-iibb-hub .lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.62;color:#5d687a}.mockup-iibb-hub .pills{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.mockup-iibb-hub .pill{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:11px;color:#596575}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-card{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:26px;padding:29px;box-shadow:0 20px 46px #20375829;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-card:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:220px;height:220px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffffff08;right:-70px;top:-80px}.mockup-iibb-hub .map{height:130px;display:grid;place-items:center}.mockup-iibb-hub .map-shape{width:118px;height:116px;background:#4e6d99;clip-path:polygon(40% 0,63% 8%,76% 24%,68% 40%,82% 56%,66% 72%,55% 100%,38% 81%,27% 64%,13% 46%,27% 27%);position:relative}.mockup-iibb-hub .map-shape:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#76caa9;left:53px;top:39px;box-shadow:0 0 0 7px #76caa930}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-card h2{text-align:center;font-size:23px;margin:7px 0 6px}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-card p{text-align:center;color:#c8d4e3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-mini{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:21px}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-mini div{background:#ffffff11;padding:14px;border-radius:13px}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-mini small{display:block;font-size:8px;color:#b9c9dc;margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-iibb-hub .hero-mini strong{font-size:18px}.mockup-iibb-hub .finder{padding:75px 0}.mockup-iibb-hub .section-head{text-align:center;max-width:690px;margin:0 auto 30px}.mockup-iibb-hub .section-head h2{font-size:39px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:9px 0}.mockup-iibb-hub .section-head p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}.mockup-iibb-hub .search-box{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 25px;position:relative}.mockup-iibb-hub .search-box span{position:absolute;left:16px;top:14px;color:#7e8999}.mockup-iibb-hub .search-box input{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:0 16px 0 42px;outline:none}.mockup-iibb-hub .search-box input:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #3c78d319}.mockup-iibb-hub .province-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}.mockup-iibb-hub .province{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:#fff;min-height:57px;padding:12px 14px;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.mockup-iibb-hub .province strong{font-size:11px}.mockup-iibb-hub .province small{font-size:9px;color:#7c8797}.mockup-iibb-hub .province:hover,.mockup-iibb-hub .province.selected{border-color:var(--blue);background:var(--sky)}.mockup-iibb-hub .quick{padding:75px 0;background:var(--cream)}.mockup-iibb-hub .calc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.92fr 1.08fr;gap:20px;align-items:start}.mockup-iibb-hub .panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:27px}.mockup-iibb-hub .panel h3{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 5px}.mockup-iibb-hub .intro{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 21px}.mockup-iibb-hub .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}.mockup-iibb-hub .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-iibb-hub .field label{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-iibb-hub .field input,.mockup-iibb-hub .field select{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #d4dae3;border-radius:11px;background:white;padding:0 13px;outline:none;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-iibb-hub .field input:focus,.mockup-iibb-hub .field select:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #3c78d319}.mockup-iibb-hub .money{position:relative}.mockup-iibb-hub .money span{position:absolute;left:13px;top:14px;color:#7b8596}.mockup-iibb-hub .money input{padding-left:29px}.mockup-iibb-hub .help{font-size:9px;color:#8791a0;line-height:1.4;margin-top:5px}.mockup-iibb-hub .go{height:51px;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:white;font-weight:850;margin-top:20px}.mockup-iibb-hub .privacy{text-align:center;color:#8993a2;font-size:9px}.mockup-iibb-hub .result{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:#fff;position:sticky;top:18px}.mockup-iibb-hub .result-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.mockup-iibb-hub .result h3{color:white}.mockup-iibb-hub .result .intro{color:#c6d2e1}.mockup-iibb-hub .status{height:max-content;background:#ffffff13;color:#c3d5ed;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:900}.mockup-iibb-hub .big-label{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#afc0d6;margin-top:22px}.mockup-iibb-hub .big{font-size:43px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:5px 0}.mockup-iibb-hub .sub{font-size:11px;color:#d1dbe8;line-height:1.5}.mockup-iibb-hub .progress{margin:21px 0 17px;background:#ffffff0e;border-radius:14px;padding:16px}.mockup-iibb-hub .progress-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px}.mockup-iibb-hub .track{height:9px;border-radius:99px;background:#ffffff1b;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0}.mockup-iibb-hub .track i{display:block;height:100%;width:76%;background:#6bd2ad;border-radius:inherit}.mockup-iibb-hub .progress p{font-size:9px;color:#c6d2e1;line-height:1.45;margin:0}.mockup-iibb-hub .rows{border-top:1px solid #ffffff1a}.mockup-iibb-hub .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff12;font-size:11px;color:#c6d2e1}.mockup-iibb-hub .row strong{color:white;text-align:right}.mockup-iibb-hub .row .good{color:#6fe0b8}.mockup-iibb-hub .row .warn{color:#ffc083}.mockup-iibb-hub .notice{background:#ffffff0c;border-radius:11px;padding:13px;margin-top:17px;color:#cbd8e7;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}.mockup-iibb-hub .detail-link{display:block;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;background:white;color:var(--blue);border-radius:11px;padding:13px;margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:850}.mockup-iibb-hub .activities{padding:75px 0}.mockup-iibb-hub .activity-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:12px}.mockup-iibb-hub .activity{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:17px;background:#fff;text-align:left;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-iibb-hub .activity strong,.mockup-iibb-hub .activity span,.mockup-iibb-hub .activity small{display:block}.mockup-iibb-hub .activity span{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:11px}.mockup-iibb-hub .activity strong{font-size:12px;min-height:30px}.mockup-iibb-hub .activity small{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px}.mockup-iibb-hub .activity:hover{border-color:var(--blue);transform:translateY(-2px)}.mockup-iibb-hub .explain{padding:75px 0;background:var(--cream)}.mockup-iibb-hub .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.mockup-iibb-hub .info{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px}.mockup-iibb-hub .info span{font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--blue)}.mockup-iibb-hub .info h3{font-size:17px;margin:9px 0}.mockup-iibb-hub .info p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}.mockup-iibb-hub .info.dark{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:white}.mockup-iibb-hub .info.dark span,.mockup-iibb-hub .info.dark p{color:#c4d1e2}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq{padding:75px 0}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:60px}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq h2{font-size:37px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq-intro p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid #d7dce4}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq-item button{width:100%;border:0;background:transparent;padding:19px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);font-weight:850}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq-item button b{font-size:20px;color:var(--blue)}.mockup-iibb-hub .answer{display:none;padding:0 30px 19px 0;font-size:12px;color:#616d80;line-height:1.6}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq-item.open .answer{display:block}.mockup-iibb-hub .faq-item.open button b{transform:rotate(45deg)}.mockup-iibb-hub footer{background:#111d31;color:#bdc9d9;padding:38px 0;font-size:11px}.mockup-iibb-hub footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.mockup-iibb-hub footer strong{color:white}
